Package: bioconice
Title: Query bioc-on-ice Releases of Bioconductor Annotation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sean",
           family = "Davis",
           email = "seandavi@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8991-6458")),
    person(given = "National Cancer Institute",
           role = "fnd",
           comment = "ITCR award U24CA289073"))
Description: bioc-on-ice publishes the annotation behind Bioconductor's
    OrgDb, TxDb and EnsDb packages, plus GO and other ontologies,
    orthologs, interactions, pathways, GWAS Catalog associations and
    literature links, as weekly releases of Parquet tables with DuckDB
    views. bioconice attaches a release to DuckDB read-only over HTTPS,
    so every species and source can be queried with SQL or dplyr without
    installing an annotation package or downloading the data, and a
    release can be pinned by date for reproducible analyses.
